OL,3,GNEWSAPenguins to move from London to
OL,4,ABirmingham in 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FA controversial indoor penguin
OL,7,Fenclosure at Sea Life London Aquarium
OL,8,Fis to close within two years following
OL,9,Fconcerns about the birds' welfare.
OL,11,FThe group of 14 gentoo penguins, which
OL,12,Fcurrently has no access to natural
OL,13,Flight or fresh air, is to join 16
OL,14,Fothers at the National Sea Life Centre
OL,15,Fin Birmingham in a new outdoor space.
OL,17,FIt comes after a high-profile campaign
OL,18,Fby Freedom for Animals, the Born Free
OL,19,FFoundation, MPs and members of the
OL,20,Fpublic.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
